{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id344419383"}, "name":{"label":"siminaiwen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-29T17:06:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.4.0"}, "id":{"label":"10994195962"}, "title":{"label":"One suggestion"}, "content":{"label":"This is a really great app that caters to ADHD - the ability to colour code is great (though I do frequently forget niche colour sets, so I do have to go back and forth a little bit), the way each day is set out is amazing, and I love the fact our all-day tasks are set at the top.\n\nOne thing about those however, is that if you have a lot of all day tasks, the overflow is off screen - so out of sight, out of mind. Perhaps there could be an option in settings that will automatically sort completed tasks to the end, off the screen? That way people can choose if they want to sort or not, and I don’t have to try and remember to scroll for each day just to check if I have extra tasks, risking forgetting and missing tasks.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
