{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1498452772"}, "name":{"label":"Lollipop#3000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-19T15:59:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"10719961975"}, "title":{"label":"Good but not intuitive enough"}, "content":{"label":"The app looks clean and works well. However, it is cumbersome to select the duration and start time of each task. It would be nice if there was an easy and intuitive way to drag tasks into the timeline and adjust the time of the task by dragging.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id509866849"}, "name":{"label":"ISSNE2210"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-19T04:44:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"10717221598"}, "title":{"label":"The best daily planner app ever!"}, "content":{"label":"Literally the best app for daily planning. Really helps me organise tasks and make the most of every minute whilst keeping track of progress. The AI planner is also such a great feature - talking through my next day’s plans every evening helps me organise, which is then cleverly converted into scheduled tasks. Would not hesitate to recommend!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id531996682"}, "name":{"label":"jdhdyyehxvfkro"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-04T23:39:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"10659049611"}, "title":{"label":"Very good but …"}, "content":{"label":"This app is great setting me up for the whole day if you are considering getting it do it it helps me stay on task but not only that it helps me improve my routine… but there’s always room for improvement so maybe you could add an alarm so that you know to stop or to start finishing that task then tick it off then go to the next task ( I don’t know if there is an alarm and if so I love this app even more but I can’t find the alarm if there is one ) but overall I love this app very much .", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id305874832"}, "name":{"label":"Sarah184308"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-29T12:51:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"10639483106"}, "title":{"label":"Game changer for productivity"}, "content":{"label":"I love how this app helps to gamify productivity, making it fun to do your tasks with beautiful icons, fun colours and intuitive design. It also makes you want to get organised because it’s so easy to do. I use it to bring together work, study and personal activities to make sure I have everything in one place. \n\nThe notifications and timers keep me on track. I haven’t even mentioned the AI assistant that lets you verbally ramble about your day’s plans and then turns them into entries into your planner, saving time and typing. I rarely pay for apps but I really feel like I made a good investment here. I even more rarely leave reviews for apps but here I am! Hope this app changes your life too", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
